<title>HONG KONG: China building materials maker to offer A shares.</title>
<headline>China building materials maker to offer A shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beijing-based Beixin Building Materials (Group) Co Ltd plans to apply to the China Securities Regulatory Commission for an offer of 45 million A shares in 1997, a company spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Shenzhen-based China Southern Securities Co Ltd has been named lead underwriter for the offer, which would be listed on the Shenzhen Stock Exchange, he told the Hong Kong-based newsletter China Securities Bulletin.</p>
<p>If successful, Beixin would use the stock proceeds to expand its core business, the official said.</p>
<p>He declined to give further details.</p>
</text>
